            <h1 class="article-title mt-2">OCI Card Benefits and Restrictions: What OCI Cardholders Can and Cannot Do in India</h1>
            <p class="article-subtitle">
                Understand OCI card benefits and restrictions in India, including travel, employment, property ownership, education, political rights and activities requiring special permission.
            </p>
            <div class="article-meta-row">
                <div class="article-meta-item">
                    <i class="bi bi-person-fill text-gold"></i>
