                <img src="assets/images/oci-card-benefits-restrictions.jpg" alt="OCI Card Benefits and Restrictions: What OCI Cardholders Can and Cannot Do in India" class="featured-image">
                <div class="featured-image-caption">
                    Comprehensive legal overview of Overseas Citizen of India privileges, lifelong visa status, property ownership, professional practice and statutory limitations under Indian law.
                </div>
