                                <div id="collapseFaq2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFaq2" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        The OCI scheme provides a multiple-entry, lifelong visa and an exemption from FRRO/FRO registration for any length of stay, subject to the applicable conditions. This is not the same as Indian citizenship or an unconditional right to undertake every activity in India.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- FAQ 3 -->
                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h3 class="accordion-header" id="headingFaq3">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFaq3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFaq3">
