                                <div id="collapseFaq4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFaq4" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        Generally, an OCI cardholder may purchase eligible immovable property other than agricultural land, a farmhouse or plantation property, subject to applicable laws and restrictions. A property-specific review is advisable before a transaction.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- FAQ 5 -->
                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h3 class="accordion-header" id="headingFaq5">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFaq5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFaq5">
                                        5. Can an OCI cardholder buy agricultural land in India?
                                    </button>
