                                <div id="collapseFaq5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFaq5" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        The official OCI scheme excludes the acquisition of agricultural land, farmhouses and plantation property under its stated property benefit. Other forms of transfer, including inheritance, require separate examination under the applicable laws.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- FAQ 6 -->
                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h3 class="accordion-header" id="headingFaq6">
