                                <div id="collapseFaq8" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFaq8" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        Generally, OCI cardholders are not entitled to public-service appointments connected with the Union or a State unless a specific exception or special order applies. The recruitment rules for the particular post should be checked.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- FAQ 9 -->
